# Chasing Quotas (sandoria 95) with its era module (quest rework P4): modules/era/lua/quests/sandoria/chasing_quotas.lua,
# enabled by its condition xi.pre(xi.expansion.SOA) (RESTRICT_CONTENT 1, ENABLE_SOA 0), wraps section 2's Port San
# d'Oria onEventFinish 17: the quest's own finish (the hairpin taken, Prog 1, Wait = now + 60), then Wait = JstMidnight()
# (1800025200, seven hours after the harness clock's 1800000000), where the quest's own leaves 1800000060. Accepted by
# GM at Prog 0 with the hairpin: 17; Ceraulian's 3 (the wait); a JST day later 7 (Prog 2).
module modules/era/lua/quests/sandoria/chasing_quotas.lua
lists PortSanDoria/Ceraulian/onTrade PortSanDoria/onEventFinish/17
char zone=PortSanDoria pos=0.626,-8,-120.914 job=DRG lvl=50
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_SOA 0
quest Sandoria.TheHolyCrest completed
quest Sandoria.ACraftsmansWork completed
quest Sandoria.ChasingQuotas accepted
item GoldHairpin
login
trade Ceraulian GoldHairpin x1            # Prog 0, just the hairpin: 17
finish                                    # the hairpin taken; Prog 1; Wait = JstMidnight() (the module), not now + 60
trigger Ceraulian                         # Prog 1, now before Wait: 3
finish
wait jst=1                                # past the next JST midnight
trigger Ceraulian                         # Prog 1, now past Wait: 7
finish                                    # Prog 2
